{"name":"Mystification","hex":"#2a4071","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"mystification","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of mystifying or the condition of being mystified.","A mystifying thing."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mystification"}],"entries":[{"title":"Mystification (Diderot)","blocks":[{"text":"Mystification or l'Histoire des portraits is an unfinished work from 1768 by Denis Diderot. It was published in 1951. A second edition in 1954 by Pierre Daix, annotated by Yves Benot was illustrated with four sketches by Pablo Picasso, for Les Éditeurs français réunis. A film based on the work was directed by Sandrine Rinaldi in 2005."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/81/Mystification_%28Diderot%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mystification_(Diderot)"},{"title":"Mystification (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Mystification is the sixth studio album by American heavy metal band Manilla Road, released in 1987. It was re-released in 2000 on Sentinel Steel Records."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/39/Manilla_road_mystification_original.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mystification_(album)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/81/Mystification_%28Diderot%29.jpg/250px-Mystification_%28Diderot%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/81/Mystification_%28Diderot%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/81/Mystification_%28Diderot%29.jpg/250px-Mystification_%28Diderot%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikiped